{"id":"vod_sn_37365","vodId":"37365","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"幽游白书","name_cn":"幽游白书","date":"1992-01-01","year":"1992","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/fd28f54518f8a7be9186df18d8568bbc.jpg"},"summary":"皿屋敷中学的不良少年浦饭幽助终日无所事事，或与青梅竹马雪村萤子吵架拌嘴，或拿死对头桑原和真出气。某日，逃课玩耍的幽助从车轮下救起一位小姑娘，自己则被汽车撞死。他的举动出乎灵界的预料，因此得到一个复活的机会。经过一次次的考验，幽助最终在萤子和桑原的帮助下重返人间。　　在此之后，他成为一名灵界侦探，专门负责各种奇异的犯罪事件。在一次任务中，幽助又结识了化名南野秀一的妖狐藏马和盗贼飞影。所谓不打不相识，幽助、桑原、藏马、飞影成为共同进退的搭档。他们一同参加了云集强大妖怪的暗黑武术大会，与恐怖的户愚吕兄弟一决胜负。以此为肇始，此后他们与魔界的纠葛越来越深，战斗愈加激烈……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:51:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":112,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Veb81ywt7E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t6AUnhH2Ey1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/55J0dsGRWb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cNxWEw7Jiy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q82r2tG7YB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JBt86W88091/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/B81hMKufVg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/57Bwc2xxnf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UagcY1UTBx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DxtLvGSuHk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3nEyhEPkyw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GM8pDBBfD81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hNrjykfRCJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qPDzZeC9KE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","